    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ARCH WIZARD is a fast paced First Person &quot;Hyper Shooter&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight battlefields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A few very distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many tricks in your sleeve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot mechanics to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blend all your moves, skills and abilities into one personalized flow of magic rage. A calculated ever adapting dance between enemies. Using their attacks and even detached body parts to dig into the depths of combat spell craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a powerful mage. Lost in the ruins of warp portal network,\u00a0once connecting the outskirts of the multiverse.<br>You must fight your way through cosmoses.<br>First \u2014 to get back to your Tower.<br>Second \u2014 to establish dominance on the parallel realms.<br>To go back from THE OTHER SIDE.<br>To find the source of Chaos.<br>To face the End of the World<br>To become the eternal ARCH WIZARD \u2014 an architect, a director, a tailor of your own fait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knowledge based progression. High scores. Full of secrets.<br><br>Trailer music contains tracks: Shadows And Dust by <strong><i>Scott Buckley </i></strong>and\u00a0Creepy Dark Atmosphere by\u00a0<strong><i>Universfield</i></strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">ARCH WIZARD is a fast paced First Person &quot;Hyper Shooter&quot;:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tight battlefields</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A few very distinct enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Many tricks in your sleeve</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A lot mechanics to master</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blend all your moves, skills and abilities into one personalized flow of magic rage. A calculated ever adapting dance between enemies. Using their attacks and even detached body parts to dig into the depths of combat spell craft.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a powerful mage. Lost in the ruins of warp portal network,\u00a0once connecting the outskirts of the multiverse.<br>You must fight your way through cosmoses.<br>First \u2014 to get back to your Tower.<br>Second \u2014 to establish dominance on the parallel realms.<br>To go back from THE OTHER SIDE.<br>To find the source of Chaos.<br>To face the End of the World<br>To become the eternal ARCH WIZARD \u2014 an architect, a director, a tailor of your own fait.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Knowledge based progression. High scores. Full of secrets.<br><br>Trailer music contains tracks: Shadows And Dust by <strong><i>Scott Buckley </i></strong>and\u00a0Creepy Dark Atmosphere by\u00a0<strong><i>Universfield</i></strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Fast paced &quot;Hyper Shooter&quot; complemented with esoteric exploration experience. Take a quest to become Arch Wizard: dominate surrounding realms, reverse Time, escape Death, befriend Chaos, face the End of the World. Knowledge based progression. High scores. Full of secrets.",
